# Z80 assembly: Zilog Z80 CPU User Manual (UM0080) instruction set; requirements/languages/z80.md
name     z80 z80asm
keyword  ld ldi ldir push pop ex exx add adc sub sbc and or xor cp inc dec daa cpl neg rla rra rlca rrca
keyword  jp jr djnz call ret reti retn rst nop halt di ei im in out org equ db dw ds defb defw defs
builtin  a b c d e h l af bc de hl ix iy sp i r nz z nc pe po p m
fold-case
line-comment   ;
string   " "  : escapes
string   ' '
sigil    .    : meta
sigil    $    : num
operators  +-*/(),#
hook     asm-label
